    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Varenne is an exceptional 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom semi-detached home, thoughtfully designed to combine timeless architecture with contemporary family living. Elegant red brick façades with refined limestone detailing create a distinguished exterior, while spacious, light-filled interiors provide the perfect setting for modern life.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a generous open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, centred around a large kitchen island with casual seating—ideal for family gatherings, entertaining, and everyday living. A separate living room offers a versatile space to relax, host guests, or create a dedicated home office.\r\nFinished to an exceptional standard throughout, The Varenne features premium materials, sophisticated design, and carefully considered layouts that maximise space, comfort, and natural light. Upstairs, four generously proportioned bedrooms, including a luxurious principal bedroom with en-suite, provide ample accommodation for growing families.\r\nSet within a beautifully landscaped neighbourhood with mature trees and generous green spaces, The Varenne offers an exceptional blend of quality craftsmanship, modern comfort, and community living in a well-connected setting."
      },
